sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant W as Wizard步骤组件<br/>(Step1Location/Step2Score…)
    participant C as AppContext<br/>(useReducer)
    participant DS as draftStore<br/>→StorageAdapter
    participant S as services层<br/>(async, 模拟后端)
    participant E as engine纯函数层
    participant P as PlanPage/BlacklistGate

    Note over W,DS: 全程每步变更即时落库（REQ-003，断点续填）
    U->>W: 输入省份/选科/总分
    W->>W: 前端即时校验（再选恰2门/0-750/<100二次确认）
    W->>C: dispatch(UPDATE_PROFILE)
    C->>DS: saveDraft(draft) 防抖500ms
    DS->>DS: localStorage.setItem

    W->>S: rankService.lookup(province, track, score)
    S->>E: rankLookup(分数, scoreRank.gd.json)
    E-->>S: { rank, percentile, source原文 }
    S-->>W: 位次+解读文案+证据条数据
    Note over W: REQ-002 证据展示<br/>覆盖位次→Modal二次确认(>500勾声明)

    U->>W: S3选择权重预设/微调档
    W->>S: sampleService 预览配比(ratio.ts×thresholds.json)
    S-->>W: 实时刷新配比条与分布预览(REQ-004)

    U->>W: S4自然语言意向输入
    W->>S: llmService.parseIntention(text)
    S->>S: 1.2-2s延迟+关键词解析+白名单校验
    alt 解析成功
        S-->>W: LlmParseResponse{OK, data}
        W->>U: 结构化确认卡(地域/黑名单/权重)
    else 解析失败
        S-->>W: {PARSE_FAILED}
        W->>U: 回退表单补填(REQ-006 不阻塞)
    end

    U->>W: S5特殊身份勾选 → 提交方案
    W->>S: planService.buildPlan(profile, preferences)
    S->>E: filterBlacklist(candidates, 黑名单)
    E-->>S: { blocked, surviving }
    S->>E: degrade(surviving, prefs, 45)  L1→L2按序放宽
    E-->>S: { candidates, degradeSteps }
    S->>E: planBuilder 概率/四梯度/配比排序
    E-->>S: Plan{gradientStats 2:3:3:2, completeness}
    S-->>P: Plan(含 degraded 明示记录)

    alt blacklistBlocked > 0
        P->>U: BlacklistGate硬拦截确认页(不可绕过)
        U->>P: 移出黑名单 或 继续拦截
    end
    alt candidates = 0
        P->>U: NoMatchDiagnosis诊断页(禁止静默降级)
    end
    P->>U: 渲染四梯度统计+志愿卡(EvidenceBar展开)+ComplianceNote合规标注
